.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-252-Record exactly ONE canonical iteration record through the append gateway — never write `research/deep-research-state.jsonl` directly. Build the record as a single JSON object and write it to a one-record event file (this JSON is that payload):
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-253-
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-254-```json
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md:255:{"type":"iteration","iteration":N,"mode":"research","target_agent":"deep-research","agent_definition_loaded":true,"resolved_route":"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research","run":N,"status":"complete","focus":"[focus area]","findingsCount":N,"newInfoRatio":0.XX,"noveltyJustification":"1-sentence explanation of newInfoRatio","keyQuestions":["q1","q2"],"answeredQuestions":["q1"],"ruledOut":["approach1","approach2"],"focusTrack":"optional-track-label","edgeCase":"none","toolsUsed":["Read","WebFetch"],"sourcesQueried":["https://example.com/doc","src/file.ts:42"],"timestamp":"ISO-8601","durationMs":NNNNN,"graphEvents":[]}
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-256-```
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-257-
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-258-**Status values**: `complete | timeout | error | stuck | insight | thought`
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-259-- `complete`: Normal evidence gathering with new findings
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-260-- `timeout`: Time/tool budget exceeded before finishing
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-261-- `error`: Unrecoverable iteration failure
--
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-279-node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs \
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-280-  --mode research \
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-281-  --run-directory <resolved research packet root> \
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-282-  --event-json <record file>
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-283-```
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-284-
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md:285:Here `<record file>` is a file holding the single canonical iteration record (one JSON object) — the gateway `JSON.parse`s it whole, so it must not be the multi-line `deltas/iter-NNN.jsonl`. The gateway authorizes the record against the mode's durable authority, fences it behind the ledger, returns a receipt, and refreshes `research/deep-research-state.jsonl` from the ledger. Exit `0` means the record is durable; exit `2` means it was refused — halt and name the check the refusal reports. Never fall back to a direct write of the projection file.
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-286-
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-287-**Append discipline**:
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-288-- Record exactly one canonical iteration record through the gateway per iteration.
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-289-- Optional idea capture records additional `idea_observed` events through the same gateway when dispatch explicitly allows it.
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-290-- Never record `idea_promoted` or `idea_rejected`; reducer and operator workflows own those events.
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-291-- Never edit, truncate, sort, or reformat the `research/deep-research-state.jsonl` projection — the gateway owns it.
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-292-- If the gateway returns exit 2, or the refreshed projection does not show exactly one new iteration record, return `Status: error` and name the mismatch.
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-293-
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-294-### Step 9: Write Delta
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-295-
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md:296:Create `research/deltas/iter-NNN.jsonl` once — the multi-line delta artifact the reducer consumes, separate from the one-record event file handed to the gateway in Step 8. Its first line MUST be the canonical iteration record built in Step 8. Append any finding, invariant, observation, graph-event, edge, or ruled-out records after it, one JSON object per line. Never overwrite an existing delta file.
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-297-
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-298-**newInfoRatio calculation**:
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-299-- Fully new findings count as 1.0.
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-300-- Partially new findings count as 0.5.
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-301-- `newInfoRatio = (fully_new + 0.5 * partially_new) / total_findings`.
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-302-- If there are no findings, set 0.0.
--
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-312-
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-313-Before returning, verify:
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-314-- `research/iterations/iteration-NNN.md` exists at the computed packet-local path.
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-315-- The iteration file contains Focus, Findings, Sources Consulted, Assessment, Reflection, and Recommended Next Focus sections.
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-316-- Every non-empty Finding has a `[SOURCE: ...]` or `[INFERENCE: ...]` marker.
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-317-- The append gateway returned exit 0 with a receipt, and the refreshed `research/deep-research-state.jsonl` projection shows exactly one new iteration record for this iteration.
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md:318:- The gateway event includes `type`, `run`, `status`, `focus`, `findingsCount`, `newInfoRatio`, `noveltyJustification`, `ruledOut`, `toolsUsed`, `sourcesQueried`, `timestamp`, and `durationMs`.
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-319-- No reducer-owned file or the state projection was edited directly.
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-320-- No write escaped the resolved packet root.
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-321-- No sub-agent was dispatched.
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-322-
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-323-If any item fails, fix the in-scope output if safe. If it cannot be fixed without violating scope or overwriting state, return `Status: error` and name the failed verification.
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-324-
--
.skilled/agents/deep-research.md-332-
